OL,3,ABrewdog's unpaid workers to receive
OL,4,Anothing after takeover deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Brewdog staff and several
OL,7,Fcreditors of the collapsed Scottish
OL,8,Fbeer giant are not expected to receive
OL,9,Fanything from the administration
OL,10,Fprocess.
OL,12,FA report from administrators
OL,13,FAlixPartners said there were
OL,14,F"insufficient funds" for payouts to
OL,15,Fthose owed money by Brewdog's retail
OL,16,Farm.
OL,18,FThe Aberdeenshire-based brewer had more
OL,19,Fthan #500m of debts when it was sold in
OL,20,FMarch to US drinks firm Tilray in a
OL,21,F#33m rescue deal.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
